  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;background:#FFFFFF;\">We believe in the POWER OF PLAY and we are looking for people like you - passionate about making a difference in the lives of children &amp; grandchildren by playing a role in developing and building a foundation for creative thinking and learning success all while earning an income! <br></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;letter-spacing:0.75pt;background:#FFFFFF;\">Discovery Toys</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;background:#FFFFFF;\"> is the premier learning toy company dedicated to helping early childhood development through Play. A trusted brand for over 45 years, we specialize in premium quality, kid-powered learning products for children ranging from newborns to school-aged children. We also prioritize a play experience that provides children with the fundamental skills, curiosity, and passion that leads to learning success in their school years and beyond. </span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;background:#FFFFFF;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">As many of our customers and Play Advisors can testify, a Discovery Toys product is not a typical educational toy that you can find at your local toy shop.  No one combines play and learning better than Discovery Toys.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;background:#FFFFFF;\">Our affiliate program makes it easy for you to link your site visitors to Discovery Toys and our library of learning toys, games and books.<span>  </span>You can earn 15-20% commission on sales, with no fees or minimums.<span>  </span>Don’t hesitate…sign up now and start making a difference!</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p></div>",
